   "text": "So training loss cannot be the thing we tune k against.\nOnly held-out data can see the trade-off.",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "So training loss cannot be the thing we tune k against.\nOnly held-out data can see the trade-off.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
